      "body": "A socket unit test failed (`sock_tests/send_and_receive`), so integration tests were not executed.\r\nIncluding a commit with a fix for the unit test, for a 2nd run.\r\n\r\n```\r\ntest/sock_tests.cpp(132): error: in \"sock_tests/send_and_receive\": check receiver.Recv(recv_buf, sizeof(recv_buf), 0) == msg_len has failed [1 != 4]\r\ntest/sock_tests.cpp(133): error: in \"sock_tests/send_and_receive\": check strncmp(msg, recv_buf, msg_len) == 0 has failed [1 != 0]\r\ntest/sock_tests.cpp(132): error: in \"sock_tests/send_and_receive\": check receiver.Recv(recv_buf, sizeof(recv_buf), 0) == msg_len has failed [1 != 4]\r\ntest/sock_tests.cpp(133): error: in \"sock_tests/send_and_receive\": check strncmp(msg, recv_buf, msg_len) == 0 has failed [-1 != 0]\r\n```",
